.ua/tmp/

# Session scratch from the PR-tending skills (/good:watch-my-prs,
# /good:watch-for-prs, /good:review-balance). Local working notes that name
# reviewers and internal process; they belong on disk, not in the repo.
watch-my-prs-notes.md
watch-for-prs-notes.md
.claude/review-balance-history.tsv

# Session scratch from /andrea-sweep: phase-by-phase run notes (Jira
# project/custom-field config, worktree layout, per-finding scan decisions).
# Local working notes, not repo content — landed in a PR once by accident
# (SOL-154037 review) via a stray `git add -A` during conflict resolution.
sweep-notes.md

# Generated reports and captured transcripts. Never repo content.
pr-activity-report.pdf
product-chat.md

# Built E2E agent binary.
test/e2e/agent/agent

# semp-tap builds into a suite's gitignored bin/ via build_semp_tap, but a bare
# `go build` inside its own module drops the binary next to the source.
test/e2e-common/semp-tap/semp-tap
